            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Alchemical Crossbow"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Vilree's crossbow can deliver bolts that are alchemically infused. As an action, she can slot an alchemical bomb into the crossbow, and the next 3 attacks she makes with it deal 1d6 damage of the type dealt by the bomb. These attacks never deal splash damage."
            },
